<?php

/**
 * Minimal PHPStan stubs for Magento 2 core framework/module classes — not
 * copied from anywhere, written fresh against Magento's own public,
 * open-source class names (magento/magento2 is MIT-licensed) to stop
 * PHPStan/PHPMD's expensive "unknown class" fallback resolution, which is
 * what made analysing a real module take minutes instead of seconds (see
 * CLAUDE.md's Phase 12 decision note). Declarations are intentionally
 * shallow — just enough that the symbol resolves — not a faithful
 * reproduction of Magento's real method signatures; this suppresses noise,
 * it doesn't add real type-checking against Magento's own API.
 *
 * Scoped to what the project's own fixtures actually reference (demo-store
 * + the real Ordo_Automation module), not every Magento class — add more
 * here as new "unknown class" noise shows up against other real stores.
 */

